onAirDate\":\"2003-04-09\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"All Together Alone\",\"overview\":\"Damon is arrested on drunken driving charges, and Teri tries to convince him to get help. Meanwhile, Lem discovers that Bird's former high school teacher, Michael King, is stalking Bird. Also, Ahmad catches his parents at an embarrassing time.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-09\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Life 101\",\"overview\":\"Bird is surprised to learn that she's pregnant. Meanwhile, Teri has a problem with living up to her reputation as \\\"Superchick\\\". Also, Ahmad rekindles his relationship with his ex-girlfriend Keisha.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-16\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"The New Math\",\"overview\":\"Benny's ex-girlfriend threatens to sue him for child support. Meanwhile, Teri tries to help a student. Also, Maxine and Kenny try to deal with Kelly's poor test scores.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-23\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Truth's Consequences\",\"overview\":\"A visit from Aunt Ruthie wreaks havoc in the girls' lives. Meanwhile, Damon seeks help for his drinking problem. Ahmad falls for Reggie's girl.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-30\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Shades of Grey\",\"overview\":\"Kenny takes on a mentally challenged employee at the shop. Meanwhile, Bird's deepening friendship with Eva raises eyebrows. Also, Ahmad has to report on Jewish culture for school.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-07\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"My Brother's Keeper\",\"overview\":\"Damon gets Teri's engagement ring which no one likes in the least. Meanwhile, Lionel stays with the Chadways, while Ahmad publishes an underground newspaper at his school.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-14\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Attracting Opposites\",\"overview\":\"Lem clashes with Baron Marks' son. Meanwhile, Bird takes a surprising step with Eva when Teri catches Eva and Bird sharing a kiss. Also, Ahmad is having unwelcome dreams about Bird.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-21\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Sacrifice Fly\",\"overview\":\"Damon finds himself at the center of a horrible and controversial sport tragedy. Kenny struggles with a damaged friendship, and Teri possesses one of Bird and Lem's videotapes.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-28\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Nobody's Child\",\"overview\":\"The Joseph sisters do their best to help Mandel when his mother leaves him at Maxine's. When Cameron turns to Lem for help, Lem realizes Baron isn't perfect. The size of Ahmad's family jewels is a topic of discussion when two teenage girls think they've caught a glimpse on the soccer field.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2003-06-04\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Falling From Grace\",\"overview\":\"When Estella returns, wanting Mandel back, Teri begins to investigate her rights. Tobias is released from the hospital.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2003-06-11\",\"runtime\":60}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2000-06-28\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}